This file documents the release history of the local_proctorio plugin.

=== 2.4.0 (2026082500) ===

* Replaced the legacy AJAX endpoints with Moodle External Services (classes/external/*,
  db/services.php), callable via core/ajax or lib/ajax/service.php:
  - local_proctorio_get_attempt_info — last quiz attempt for the current user.
  - local_proctorio_get_course_roster — enrolled course roster.
  - local_proctorio_get_selectors — candidate/professor CSS selector configuration.
  - local_proctorio_get_plugin_details — plugin and Moodle version information.
* Removed the endpoints these replace: ajax.php, fetchprofessorselectors.php, details.php,
  users.php, quizattemptinfo.php.
* Added the local/proctorio:viewselectors capability (system context) gating the new
  selectors/details services.
* Added missing language strings (capability names, invalidtype, and previously
  hard-coded AJAX response messages) so all user-facing text goes through get_string().

=== 2.3.0 (2024122506) ===

* Stable release.
* CSS selector configuration for candidate (student) and professor (instructor) interfaces.
* Custom SQL query support for non-standard quiz modules via admin settings.
* REST API endpoints:
  - /local/proctorio/quizattemptinfo.php — last quiz attempt for the current user.
  - /local/proctorio/users.php — enrolled course roster.
  - /local/proctorio/ajax.php — candidate CSS selectors.
  - /local/proctorio/fetchprofessorselectors.php — professor CSS selectors.
  - /local/proctorio/details.php — plugin and Moodle version information.
* Privacy API implementation declaring data shared with Proctorio.
* Plugin capability definitions (local/proctorio:viewattemptdata, local/proctorio:viewroster).
* Requires Moodle 3.9 or later.
